{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04223","headline":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋风 · 骆宾王","name":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫陌炎氛歇，青苹晚吹浮。\n乱竹摇疎影，萦池织细流。\n飘香曳舞袖，带粉泛妆楼。\n不分君恩绝，纨扇曲中秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}